// Deep groove ball bearing 6001, 12 x 28 x 8 mm, shielded on both faces:
// the outer and inner steel rings and the shields between them. Its axis
// along z, a face at z = 0, centered on the origin.
// https://www.qualitybearingsonline.ca/6001-skf-deep-groove-bearing-12-x-28-x-8mm
//
// From SKF's figures for the 6001, as Quality Bearings Online lists them:
// 12 x 28 x 8 mm, dynamic load rating 5.4 kN, static 2.36 kN, 0.02 kg (other
// sellers give 21 to 22 g, the figure here).
// The bore, outside diameter and width are ISO 15's for the designation,
// so any maker's 6001 has them. The rings' section and the shields are
// drawn, not measured. To hold it in a printed part, `bearing_seat.c2f`
// cuts its pocket.

// @description Deep groove ball bearing 6001, 12 mm bore, 28 mm outside, 8 mm
// @description wide: for a 12 mm shaft that carries a real load: a wheel's
// @description axle, a turntable's spindle.
// @spec bearing: deep groove ball bearing, single row, 6001 (SKF 6001)
// @spec bore: 12 mm
// @spec outside diameter: 28 mm
// @spec width: 8 mm
// @spec dynamic load: 5.4 kN
// @spec static load: 2.36 kN
// @spec mass: 21 g
// @source https://www.qualitybearingsonline.ca/6001-skf-deep-groove-bearing-12-x-28-x-8mm SKF 6001 at Quality Bearings Online (dimensions, load ratings, mass)

use <lib/ball_bearing.c2f>

module bearing_6001() {
    ball_bearing(12, 28, 8);
}

bearing_6001();
